%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Shrike
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 10
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Void Lance
    AbilityDescription: 'RT (held). A hitscan beam 2400 u long that breaks every block it passes - super-shielded
      included, any domain - except the nest you are docked in; a rival hull on the line is a scored
      petal hit (petals only - nothing is moved). 1.2 s cooldown, faster docked. Charge is reach - one
      dial: the beam''s radius 1.5 -> 5 u at level 10 (ShrikeConfigSO.lanceRadius).'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Nest
    AbilityDescription: 'A. Flying: build a nest round the hull - a cup of super-shielded blocks behind and around you,
      the nose''s way out open, a turret flora on top - and dock in it. Docked: undock with a push off
      the surface. Any block you touch docks you; docked, every cooldown runs x1.6 (x2.5 in a nest or
      on super-shielded mass). At most three nests; a fourth retires the oldest. Mass is volume - one
      dial: 12 -> 32 blocks per nest at level 10 (ShrikeConfigSO.nestBlocks), and the cruising
      trail''s wavelength 8 -> 4 u (trailWavelength).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Targeting Array
    AbilityDescription: 'LT (held). Paint a rival hull inside the lock cone, else the centre of the mass nearest your
      aim; each nest launches one homing missile per paint while its turret has a health block to
      spare. A missile blows on contact in an 18 u blast (a shield takes the hit first); a rival hull
      inside it is a petal hit. Space is reach - one dial: the lock cone 5 -> 14 degrees at level 10
      (ShrikeConfigSO.lockCone).'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Void Sling
    AbilityDescription: 'B. Shoot a tether (1600 u); it anchors on the first block it meets and the hull flies straight
      there in exactly 1 s, laying thick trail, docking on the first block it touches. A crystal
      resets it and gives every nest 3 health blocks. Time is rate - one dial: the cooldown 6 -> 2.5 s
      at level 10 (ShrikeConfigSO.slingCooldown).'
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
